    "name": "arrayop_op_removed",
    "description": "INVALID: `\"op\": \"arrayop\"` was the pre-0.8.0 spelling of the Functional Aggregate Query node. It was REMOVED at esm 0.8.0 and is NOT a deprecated alias \u2014 unlike `aggregate`, no loader normalizes it. A document carrying it is rejected like any other unknown non-rewrite-target op. (It survived its own removal inside the bindings until esm 1.1.0; see docs/content/rfcs/faq-node-rename.md \u00a74.)",
